<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks rose, six fell and five were flat in 12.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,624.1 points, 0.6 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.3 percent in a 10-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
